<div class="alert alert-primary mb-4 border-0 shadow-sm d-flex align-items-center p-4" style="background: var(--sb-primary-light); border-radius: 16px;">
    <div class="flex-shrink-0 me-3">
        <div class="rounded-circle d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center shadow-sm" style="width: 50px; height: 50px; background: var(--bg-card);">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info text-primary fs-4"></i>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div>
        <h5 class="alert-heading mb-1 fw-bold text-primary">How to use Kuda DataTables?</h5>
        <p class="mb-0 text-secondary" style="font-size: 14px;">
            Copy the HTML of any component below, then initialize it in your JS with:
            <code class="px-2 py-1 rounded fw-bold border" style="font-size: 13px; background: var(--bg-card); color: var(--text-dark);">KudaKit.initDataTable('your-table-id');</code>
            Or
            <code class="px-2 py-1 rounded fw-bold border" style="font-size: 13px; background: var(--bg-card); color: var(--text-dark);">$('#your-table-id').DataTable();</code>
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

